<title>USA: A.B. Electrolux to merge two units.</title>
<headline>A.B. Electrolux to merge two units.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMINGTON, Ill. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>White-Westinghouse Floor Co and Eureka Vacuum Cleaner Co, both units of A.B. Electrolux of Stockholm, Sweden, said Thursday they will merge.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to be completed by April 1.</p>
<p>Eureka said it will work with dealers who have carried White-Westinghouse products to assure a continuity in product lines. Some of the White-Westinghouse products will continue to be made under the Eureka name.</p>
<p>Eureka will supply replacement parts for White- Westinghouse vacuum cleaners.</p>
<p>	 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
